500	## HTTP Endpoints
501	
502	| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |
503	|----------|--------|---------|
504	| `/mcp` | POST | MCP JSON-RPC 2.0 |
505	| `/mcp` | GET | SSE stream (Node.js only) |
506	| `/health` | GET | Health check |
507	| `/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server` | GET | OAuth AS metadata |
508	| `/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource` | GET | OAuth RS metadata |
509	
510	OAuth (PORT+1):
511	- `GET /authorize` — Start OAuth flow
512	- `GET /oauth/callback` — Google callback
513	- `POST /token` — Token exchange
514	- `POST /revoke` — Revoke tokens
