553	
554	## Troubleshooting
555	
556	| Issue | Solution |
557	|-------|----------|
558	| "Authentication required" | Complete OAuth flow. Run `rm -rf ~/.mcp-auth` and re-authenticate. |
559	| "redirect_uri_mismatch" | Google treats `localhost` and `127.0.0.1` as different. Use `127.0.0.1` consistently in both .env and Google Cloud Console. |
560	| "unknown_txn" error | Stale mcp-remote processes. Run `pkill -9 -f mcp-remote && rm -rf ~/.mcp-auth` then retry. |
561	| "ReadableStream is not defined" | Node.js version too old (needs 18+). Use full path to newer node in config. |
562	| "spawn bunx ENOENT" | Claude Desktop can't find `bunx`. Use `npx` instead, or specify full path. |
563	| "Another instance handling auth" | Kill zombie processes: `pkill -9 -f mcp-remote && rm -rf ~/.mcp-auth` |
564	| OAuth timeout in Claude | Claude kills auth flow too quickly. Pre-authenticate manually (see Client Configuration). |
565	| Token expired | Google tokens expire after 1 hour. Refresh tokens are used automatically if `access_type=offline` was set. |
566	| OAuth doesn't start (Worker) | `curl -i -X POST https://<worker>/mcp` should return `401` with `WWW-Authenticate`. |
567	| KV namespace error | Run `wrangler kv:namespace create TOKENS` and update `wrangler.toml` with the ID. |
568	| Tools empty in Claude | Ensure Worker returns JSON Schema for `tools/list`; use `mcp-remote`. |
569	
570	### Debugging
571	
572	Enable detailed logs with `--debug`:
573	
574	```bash
575	npx mcp-remote https://your-worker.workers.dev/mcp --transport http-only --debug
576	```
577	
578	Logs are written to `~/.mcp-auth/{hash}_debug.log`.
579	
580	Test auth flow independently:
581	
582	```bash
583	npx -p mcp-remote@latest mcp-remote-client https://your-worker.workers.dev/mcp --transport http-only --debug
584	```
