588	## Environment Variables
589	
590	### Node.js (.env)
591	
592	| Variable | Required | Description |
593	|----------|----------|-------------|
594	| `PROVIDER_CLIENT_ID` | ✓ | Google OAuth Client ID |
595	| `PROVIDER_CLIENT_SECRET` | ✓ | Google OAuth Client Secret |
596	| `RS_TOKENS_ENC_KEY` | Prod | 32-byte base64 key for token encryption |
597	| `PORT` | | MCP server port (default: 3000) |
598	| `HOST` | | Server host (default: 127.0.0.1) |
599	| `LOG_LEVEL` | | debug, info, warning, error |
600	| `OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI` | | Callback URL for OAuth |
601	| `OAUTH_REDIRECT_ALLOWLIST` | | Comma-separated allowed redirect URIs |
602	
603	### Cloudflare Workers (wrangler.toml + secrets)
604	
605	**wrangler.toml vars:**
606	```toml
607	AUTH_ENABLED = "true"
608	AUTH_STRATEGY = "oauth"
609	OAUTH_SCOPES = "https://www.googleapis.com/auth/calendar.events https://www.googleapis.com/auth/calendar.readonly"
610	OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI = "https://your-worker.workers.dev/oauth/callback"
611	```
612	
613	**Secrets (set via `wrangler secret put`):**
614	- `PROVIDER_CLIENT_ID` — Google OAuth Client ID
615	- `PROVIDER_CLIENT_SECRET` — Google OAuth Client Secret  
616	- `TOKENS_ENC_KEY` — 32-byte base64url encryption key
617	
618	**KV Namespace:**
619	```toml
620	[[kv_namespaces]]
621	binding = "TOKENS"
622	id = "your-kv-namespace-id"
623	```
